---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout searchable title="Privacy and editorial policy" description="How this site handles your data, messages, corrections and licences.">
  <header class="page-head wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policies</p>
    <h1 class="display">Privacy and editorial policy.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Short version: no tracking, no cookies, no ads. Messages are used only to reply.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Browsing</h2>
      <p>This is a static website served by Cloudflare. It sets no cookies and loads no analytics, advertising or third-party fonts. If you choose a light or dark theme, that preference is stored in your own browser only. Cloudflare, as the host, processes standard connection data (such as IP addresses) to deliver and protect the site; see the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <h2>Messages</h2>
      <p>If you use the contact form, your name, email and message are delivered to me through Web3Forms, a third-party form service, and used only to reply to you. Please don't send passwords, confidential documents or information about research participants.</p>
      <h2>Public discussions</h2>
      <p>The collaboration links open GitHub Discussions and Issues. Anything posted there is public and governed by GitHub's terms.</p>
      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>Every entry shows its status and date. If you find an error, use the “Suggest a correction” link on the page. Material corrections are made openly and noted on the page with the date.</p>
      <h2>Licences</h2>
      <p>Writing, photographs and media on this site are © Daniel Khan unless stated otherwise. Each workshop resource states its own licence, and credits any work it adapts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
